# ethren (M2.10): body weight and encumbrance, docs/rules/equipment.md "Encumbrance" (an Ethren
# decision). Per race (race.ids number): the body weight is BASE + DICE d SIDES pounds; carrying more
# than HALF percent of it is half speed, more than CAP percent and the character can't move (the book:
# nobody carries more than half its body weight). The first row stands in for any other race.
         RACE BASE DICE SIDES HALF CAP
HUMAN    1    110  5    10    33   50
ELF      2    80   4    10    33   50
DWARF    4    120  4    10    33   50
HALFLING 5    40   3    10    33   50
